# Implementation Plan — Phase 2: Semantic Search & RAG

Implement vector embedding indexing using OpenAI 1536-dimensional embeddings, `pgvector` HNSW cosine similarity search, a paragraph chunking pipeline, semantic search integration into SkyVault's search bar, an interactive "Ask SkyVault AI" RAG Q&A modal, and a Recall@K evaluation suite.

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1 — Data Layer (`ai_features/models.py` & Migrations)

#### [MODIFY] [models.py](file:///c:/Programs/Python/skyvault/ai_features/models.py)

Add `DocumentChunk` model:
```python
from pgvector.django import VectorField

class DocumentChunk(models.Model):
    file = models.ForeignKey("vault.File", on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name="chunks")
    analysis = models.ForeignKey(FileAnalysis, on_delete=models.CASCADE, related_name="chunks")
    chunk_index = models.PositiveIntegerField()
    content = models.TextField()
    embedding = VectorField(dimensions=1536)
    token_count = models.PositiveIntegerField(default=0)
    created_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)

    class Meta:
        unique_together = ("file", "chunk_index")
```

