### 2 — Chunking & Embedding Pipeline

#### [NEW] `ai_features/chunking.py`

Paragraph-boundary chunking strategy:
- Split on `\n\n` paragraphs.
- Max chunk size ~2000 chars (~500 tokens).
- Overlap ~200 chars (~50 tokens).
- Minimum fragment merge threshold ~50 chars.

#### [MODIFY] [tasks.py](file:///c:/Programs/Python/skyvault/ai_features/tasks.py)

Extend `analyze_file(file_id)`:
1. After Claude analysis completes, chunk `extracted_text`.
2. Generate 1536-dim batch embeddings using `ai_features/services/embeddings.py`.
3. Idempotently delete old chunks for `file_id` and bulk-insert new `DocumentChunk` instances.

